## 3. How to Run Locally

### Via Docker Compose:
```bash
make up
```
Starts Kafka, Redis, PostgreSQL, Prometheus, Grafana, Ingestion, Aggregation Worker, and Anomaly Worker.

### Run Workers Directly:
```bash
# Aggregation Worker
python -m src.workers.aggregation.main
# or: make agg-worker

# Anomaly Detection Worker
python -m src.workers.anomaly.main
# or: make anomaly-worker
```

### Inspect Health Check Endpoints:
```bash
curl http://localhost:9101/health  # Aggregation worker
curl http://localhost:9102/health  # Anomaly worker
```
